{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id628762208"}, "name":{"label":"ghjkkhfr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-08T22:01:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.41.0"}, "id":{"label":"13938109091"}, "title":{"label":"Traveloka - Fraudulent Experience"}, "content":{"label":"I purchased airline tickets through Traveloka Vietnam and paid in full. However, when I arrived at the airport, the airline informed me that one passenger’s ticket was missing from the booking. Due to time constraints, I had no choice but to purchase a new ticket on the spot.\n\nAfter returning, I contacted Traveloka Vietnam, but their responses were evasive and they avoided taking responsibility. In the end, I lost money because of this situation.\n\nMy advice: book directly with the airline. Do not purchase through Traveloka, as there is a real risk of missing your flight and not getting a refund.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=898244857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
