{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id550022190"}, "name":{"label":"Đậu Kiêu"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-03T05:27:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.41.0"}, "id":{"label":"13917667318"}, "title":{"label":"Hỗ trợ kém"}, "content":{"label":"Mình đã sử dụng nhiều app mua vé trung gian nhưng traveloka là chán nhất :))) Hãng đổi chuyến nối của mình nên mình có nhắn traveloka hỗ trợ. Tuy nhiên, traveloka chỉ hỏi và bảo bạn tự thao tác trên app (trên app không có hỗ trợ đổi chuyến nối, chỉ có đổi cả chuyến).", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=898244857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/reviews/id409841490"}, "name":{"label":"Retspihied"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-03T01:57:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.41.0"}, "id":{"label":"13917140802"}, "title":{"label":"Extremely frustrating experience"}, "content":{"label":"I booked a flight through Traveloka and followed their instructions exactly when entering my name. Their form literally says “Middle & First Name,” which led to my given names being entered in the wrong order (even though all names were correct).\n\nBecause of THEIR confusing and poorly designed system, I ended up with a ticket that didn’t match my passport format.\n\nWhat made it worse:\n\t•\tSupport kept sending generic, copy-paste responses\n\t•\tNo clear solution after 48+ hours\n\t•\tAirline told me to contact Traveloka\n\t•\tTraveloka told me to contact the airline\n\t•\tComplete runaround with zero accountability\n\nThis caused unnecessary stress right before an international trip.\n\nThis is NOT a user error — it’s bad UX and misleading instructions. A simple fix on their end could prevent this from happening to others.\n\nVery disappointing experience. I expected much better from a major booking platform.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/vn/review?id=898244857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
